# The Mine Glove's mines, thrown several ways (a tester's picture: "one of my mines became an oval", a mine on the ground
# drawn about twice as long as wide). QUEST_SIM_GIVE=17 QUEST_SIM_HOLD=17 on Novalis (--level 1), with
# QUEST_ROWS_TRACE=74: "[sim] rows tick N: slot S class 74 ... (even)" for each mine as it is made and "(UNEVEN)" if its
# three rows ever differ in length or lean together, which is what draws one stretched. The shots are to be looked at.
# 0.1.18 on PC, also with QUEST_VR_OPTIONS="world_scale 135": every mine even, its rows square ("lean 0.000"), held,
# thrown, lying and hit by the wrench; round in the shots. Not reproduced. The game's own code: a held mine copies the
# glove's joint (flag 0x100), a thrown one has it cleared and its rows built again from its turn and scale; the mod gives
# a thrown one only its place and speed. The tester's picture was a boss's lava arena (no level or log given).
# A fast throw by hand, forward and up.
600 y 1
606 y 0
3200 shot ahead
3300 right_trigger 1
3350 shot held-1
3360 rh_z -0.05
3360 rh_y 0.02
3361 rh_z -0.10
3361 rh_y 0.05
3362 rh_z -0.15
3362 rh_y 0.08
3363 rh_z -0.20
3363 rh_y 0.11
3364 rh_z -0.25
3364 rh_y 0.13
3364 right_trigger 0
3365 rh_z -0.30
3365 rh_y 0.15
3380 shot far-1
3440 shot far-2
3500 rh_z 0
3500 rh_y 0
# Held and let go without moving: kept in the glove.
3600 right_trigger 1
3660 right_trigger 0
3680 shot kept
# A gentle lob, about 1.5 m/s: it lands a step ahead.
3800 right_trigger 1
3860 rh_z -0.02
3861 rh_z -0.04
3862 rh_z -0.06
3863 rh_z -0.08
3863 right_trigger 0
3864 rh_z -0.10
3900 shot lob-1
3960 shot lob-2
4000 rh_z 0
# The hand rolled and pitched as it throws, the trigger let go mid-turn.
4100 right_trigger 1
4150 hand_roll 60
4155 hand_pitch 30
4160 rh_z -0.05
4161 rh_z -0.10
4162 rh_z -0.15
4163 rh_z -0.20
4163 right_trigger 0
4164 rh_z -0.25
4200 shot turned-1
4260 shot turned-2
4300 rh_z 0
4300 hand_roll 0
4300 hand_pitch 0
# The grip's wrench swung hard, let go, and a mine thrown at once after it.
4400 right_grip 1
4440 rh_x 0.30
4442 rh_x 0.15
4444 rh_x 0.0
4446 rh_x -0.15
4448 rh_x -0.30
4460 right_grip 0
4470 rh_x 0
4480 right_trigger 1
4540 rh_z -0.05
4541 rh_z -0.10
4542 rh_z -0.15
4543 rh_z -0.20
4543 right_trigger 0
4544 rh_z -0.25
4580 shot after-wrench-1
4640 shot after-wrench-2
4700 rh_z 0
# Looking down at where they lie.
4760 head_pitch -35
4800 shot down-1
4900 shot down-2
5000 quit 0
